{"id":55102,"mal_id":55102,"title":"Girls Band Cry","englishTitle":null,"title_english":null,"alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"","ja":"ガールズバンドクライ"},"synopsis":"Everyone yearns to find their true purpose in life. This is also true for Nina Iseri, a 17-year-old girl looking to enroll in a good university, but the world always seems to work against her. On her very first day in Tokyo, she gets lost, ignored, and locked out of her new apartment. However, an unexpected opportunity arises when Nina meets Momoka Kawaragi, one of her favorite guitarists.\n\nAfter Nina joins Momoka for a street performance, Momoka decides they should start a band together. While Nina initially hesitates, her determination grows as they start acquiring more bandmates—the beautiful drummer Subaru Awa, the aloof keyboardist Tomo Ebizuka, and the intelligent bassist Rupa. The five girls face challenges both in the music industry and within themselves, but their shared passion for music never lets them give up on their dreams.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Todo el mundo anhela encontrar su verdadero propósito en la vida. Esto también se aplica a Nina Iseri, una chica de 17 años que busca matricularse en una buena universidad, pero el mundo siempre parece jugar en su contra. En su primer día en Tokio, se pierde, la ignoran y la dejan fuera de su nuevo apartamento. Sin embargo, surge una oportunidad inesperada cuando Nina conoce a Momoka Kawaragi, uno de sus guitarristas favoritos.\n\nDespués de que Nina se une a Momoka para una actuación callejera, Momoka decide que deberían formar una banda juntos. Si bien Nina inicialmente duda, su determinación crece a medida que comienzan a adquirir más compañeros de banda: el hermoso baterista Subaru Awa, el distante tecladista Tomo Ebizuka y el inteligente bajista Rupa. Las cinco chicas enfrentan desafíos tanto en la industria de la música como dentro de sí mismas, pero su pasión compartida por la música nunca les permite renunciar a sus sueños.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1430,"average_episode_duration":1430,"startDate":"2024-04-06","start_date":"2024-04-06","endDate":"2024-06-29","end_date":"2024-06-29","season":"spring","year":2024,"start_season":{"year":2024,"season":"spring"},"episodes":13,"num_episodes":13,"score":8.35,"mean":8.35,"numListUsers":145924,"num_list_users":145924,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":19,"name":"Music"}],"studios":[{"id":18,"name":"Toei Animation"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1711/140515.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1711/140515l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1711/140515.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1711/140515l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1711/140515l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"saturday","time":"00:30","day_of_the_week":"saturday","start_time":"00:30","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"saturday 00:30"},"rank":285,"popularity":1866,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":58639,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2023-04-24T03:56:48+00:00","updated_at":"2025-09-23T13:16:49+00:00","source":"original","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":55986,"title":"Na mo Naki Nanimo Kamo","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1151/137138.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1151/137138l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"other","relation_type_formatted":"Other"},{"node":{"id":55987,"title":"Itsuwari no Kotowari","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1785/137139.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1785/137139l.webp"}},"relation_type":"oth